| **Command**     | **What it does**                                |
| --------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| `df -h`         | Displays disk usage in a human-readable format. |
| `du -sh folder` | Shows the size of a folder.                     |
| `mount`         | Displays mounted file systems.                  |
| `umount`        | Unmounts a file system.                         |
| `lsblk`         | Lists block storage devices.                    |
| `fdisk -l`      | Displays disk partition information.            |
